# review-checklist.md template

```markdown
# Review Checklist: [Project Name]

## Functional review
- [ ] core flow works
- [ ] key user actions work
- [ ] edge cases considered

## Security review
- [ ] no secrets in source
- [ ] auth and roles verified
- [ ] data protection reviewed

## Architecture review
- [ ] modules are isolated
- [ ] business logic is organized
- [ ] future integrations are prepared

## DevOps review
- [ ] local environment runs
- [ ] env config documented
- [ ] health checks exist

## Definition of done
A task or change is done only if:
- [ ] feature works
- [ ] tests pass
- [ ] docs updated
- [ ] security reviewed
- [ ] acceptance criteria validated
- [ ] diff reviewed
```
